It is afternoon now.
Rohan and I are in the office canteen.
We are taking a break from work.
I have my lunchbox.
Rohan is bringing hot food from the counter.
He has a plate in his hand.
He comes to the table and sits.
"Maya, what are you eating?" Rohan asks.
I open my lunchbox.
"I am eating rice and vegetables," I tell him.
"What is on your plate?" I ask Rohan.
"I am eating chapati and dal," Rohan says.
We are eating our lunch.
The canteen is very crowded today.
Many people are talking loudly.
We are having a nice chat.
The food is very tasty.
After lunch, we drink tea.
Then we go back to our desks.
